= The Delegation of 2000

Two thousand senators, from the Caucus and from almost every other bloc, have signed a declaration of principle: the emergency powers must end with the war, and the Senate's authority must be restored. They call themselves the **Delegation of 2000**. Bail Organa, Mon Mothma[? if padme_alive : , Padmé Amidala ?] and Fang Zar are among its leaders.

It is the largest organised opposition to the Chancellery in a generation. The Chancellor smiles and says it shows "the health of our democracy".
